Subject: IR2 Parser Projection Expected SQLite Projection Ledger
Date: 2026-05-26
Expected Ledger UUID: feab0b00-3d5f-4407-9291-46ba7cd04794

& [ExpectedSQLiteProjectionLedger: IR2ParserProjection] is the expected SQLite projection ledger for IR2 fixtures
  + [fixture_set] is ir2_parser_projection
  + [ledger_status] is expected_output_authority_after_IR2-IA02_review
  + [required_field_set] is fixture_id, expected_projection_table_set, expected_projection_row_count_by_table, expected_source_hash_columns_present, expected_authority_state_columns_present, expected_freshness_state_columns_present, expected_projection_status_columns_present, expected_generated_artifact_set, expected_non_authority_notice, expected_rebuild_or_refusal_state, and acceptance_status

& [ExpectedSQLiteProjectionCases] is the expected SQLite projection case set
  + [case] is valid_signed_canonical_artifact | authority_records, source_artifacts, validation_results | rows_present | generated_sqlite_non_authority | rebuild_allowed
  + [case] is source_only_unprocessed_artifact | source_artifacts, validation_results | source_only_rows_present | generated_sqlite_non_authority | rebuild_allowed
  + [case] is missing_signature_canonical_artifact | validation_results, fault_records | blocked_rows_present | generated_sqlite_non_authority | rebuild_refusal_for_authority_projection
  + [case] is wrong_protocol_signature | validation_results, fault_records | blocked_rows_present | generated_sqlite_non_authority | rebuild_refusal_for_authority_projection
  + [case] is stale_source_hash | validation_results, fault_records | stale_rows_present | generated_sqlite_non_authority | rebuild_refusal_for_stale_authority
  + [case] is malformed_sop_structure | parse_faults, validation_results | fault_rows_present | generated_sqlite_non_authority | rebuild_refusal_for_malformed_source
  + [case] is unresolved_natural_key | validation_results, fault_records | blocked_rows_present | generated_sqlite_non_authority | rebuild_refusal_for_unresolved_identity
  + [case] is broken_lineage | validation_results, fault_records | blocked_rows_present | generated_sqlite_non_authority | rebuild_refusal_for_broken_lineage
  + [case] is generated_projection_non_authority | projection_notices, validation_results | notice_rows_present | generated_sqlite_non_authority | rebuild_allowed_as_projection_only
  + [case] is source_mutation_refusal | fault_records, validation_results | refusal_rows_present | generated_sqlite_non_authority | rebuild_refusal_for_source_mutation
